;
; How Stillwater files a quiet schedule, in MYRA: its number, its mode, the
; days it runs (a mask), the minutes its window opens and closes, and how
; many people are on its allow list. Eve says what the values may mean;
; this says whether they make a record.
^ZXQUIET(schedule:i3) = mode:i1! ^ days:i3! ^ opens:i4! ^ closes:i4! ^ allowed:i3!
